{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "节点被蒙住眼",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 106.78,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "前面是你问节点，节点答错。",
   "spoken": "前面是你问节点，节点答错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.262
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "另一种情况，是节点自己看到的网络，被人操纵。",
   "spoken": "另一种情况，是节点自己看到的网络，被人操纵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 4.7,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 4.793,
   "speechEnd": 8.63
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "节点之间直接交换区块和交易，这叫 P2P 网络。",
   "spoken": "节点之间直接交换区块和交易，这叫 P2P 网络。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 9.08,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 9.08,
   "speechEnd": 13.033
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "日蚀攻击，是攻击者占满受害节点的全部对等连接。",
   "spoken": "日蚀攻击，是攻击者占满受害节点的全部对等连接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 13.46,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 13.555,
   "speechEnd": 18.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "节点只看到攻击者给的区块和交易。",
   "spoken": "节点只看到攻击者给的区块和交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 18.48,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 18.48,
   "speechEnd": 21.258
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "最关键的一步，在节点重启。",
   "spoken": "最关键的一步，在节点虫启。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 21.74,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 21.74,
   "speechEnd": 24.244
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "重启时，节点会从地址表里挑选对等节点。",
   "spoken": "虫启时，节点会从地址表里挑选对等节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 24.68,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 24.68,
   "speechEnd": 28.997
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "地址表如果已经被攻击者填满，它连上的就全是攻击者。",
   "spoken": "地址表如果已经被攻击者填满，它连上的就全是攻击者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 29.46,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 29.46,
   "speechEnd": 34.246
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "2018 年的一篇论文显示，两台主机、各一个 IP，就能日蚀一个以太坊节点。",
   "spoken": "2018 年的一篇论文显示，两台主机、各一个 IP，就能日蚀一个以太坊节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 34.64,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 34.747,
   "speechEnd": 41.256
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "Geth 1.8.0 随后限制了同一网段的节点数。",
   "spoken": "Geth 1.8.0 随后限制了同一网段的节点数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 41.66,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 41.755,
   "speechEnd": 45.818
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "比特币加了锚点连接，重启时优先恢复上次的出站连接。",
   "spoken": "比特币加了锚点连接，虫启时优先恢复上次的出站连接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 46.2,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 46.3,
   "speechEnd": 51.387
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "被日蚀的节点，同步状态看起来正常。",
   "spoken": "被日蚀的节点，同步状态看起来正常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 51.78,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 51.888,
   "speechEnd": 55.087
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "它有连接，也有新块，只是落后，或者在错误的分支上。",
   "spoken": "它有连接，也有新块，只是落后，或者在错误的分支上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 55.52,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 55.52,
   "speechEnd": 59.919
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "对等节点数只说明有连接，不说明连接来自独立的运营方。",
   "spoken": "对等节点数只说明有连接，不说明连接来自独立的运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 60.3,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 60.404,
   "speechEnd": 65.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "节点崩溃，也可能是攻击的第一步。",
   "spoken": "节点崩溃，也可能是攻击的第一步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 65.56,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 65.655,
   "speechEnd": 68.27
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "切换逻辑如果把流量转到不可信的备用节点，DoS 就成了数据污染的前置步骤。",
   "spoken": "切换逻辑如果把流量转到不可信的备用节点，DoS 就成了数据污染的前置步骤。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 68.66,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 68.66,
   "speechEnd": 76.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "开头的事件正是这样。",
   "spoken": "开头的事件正是这样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 76.48,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speechStart": 76.577,
   "speechEnd": 77.972
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "另一类事故，来自节点自己的配置。",
   "spoken": "另一类事故，来自节点自己的配置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 78.38,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 78.473,
   "speechEnd": 81.218
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "2018 年，一个团伙扫描暴露 JSON-RPC 的以太坊节点，盗走约 3.8 万个 ETH。",
   "spoken": "2018 年，一个团伙扫描暴露 JSON-RPC 的以太坊节点，盗走约 3.8 万个 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 81.64,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 81.734,
   "speechEnd": 88.741
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "Geth 默认只监听本机，接口是运营者自己打开的。",
   "spoken": "Geth 默认只监听本机，接口是运营者自己打开的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 89.14,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 89.14,
   "speechEnd": 93.368
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "RPC 接口只绑内网或本机，对外必须经过认证网关。",
   "spoken": "RPC 接口只绑内网或本机，对外必须经过认证网关。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 93.76,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 93.851,
   "speechEnd": 98.216
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "给执行客户端下指令的 Engine API，只对共识客户端开放，并用 JWT 认证。",
   "spoken": "给执行客户端下指令的 Engine API，只对共识客户端开放，并用 JWT 认证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-21.wav",
